# Figma — tworzenie komponentów (Design System)

When creating or editing components via `use_figma` in the Design System file.

## Less is more — warianty i stany

**Default: one `COMPONENT` (not a variant grid).** Expand only when the user explicitly asks.

```text
✅ Prefer                          ❌ Avoid unless asked
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Single component                   COMPONENT_SET size×type grids
BOOLEAN: Show Footer               position=left|right variants
SLOT: Content, Footer              state=hover|pressed on shells
TEXT: Title                        type=default|destructive axes
Default footer = button instances  Multiple sizes as variants
INSTANCE_SWAP / icon instances
```

Do **not** proactively add sizes, positions, semantic types, interaction states.

## Wzorce referencyjne (stan w pliku — user-approved)

### `modal` — [`280:377`](https://www.figma.com/design/p522mlcVwW78HOdKKBupPE/Design-System?node-id=280-377)

```
modal (COMPONENT)
├── Header — Title (TEXT) + close icon instance
├── Conent (SLOT) — slot na treść; placeholder Description
└── Footer (SLOT) — Cancel + Confirm (button instances); ukrywany przez boolean
```

| Property | Type | Default |
|---|---|---|
| `Title` | TEXT | Tytul modala |
| `Show Footer` | BOOLEAN | true |
| `Conent` | SLOT | — |
| `Footer` | SLOT | — |

Tokeny: `component/modal/background`, `component/modal/border`, `component/modal/title/foreground`, `component/modal/padding`, `component/modal/radius`, drop shadow via `component/*` → `semantic/shadow/*`.

### `panel` — [`280:750`](https://www.figma.com/design/p522mlcVwW78HOdKKBupPE/Design-System?node-id=280-750)

```
panel (COMPONENT) — 320×640
├── Header — Title + close icon
├── Content (SLOT)
└── Footer (SLOT) — 2× button; Show Footer boolean
```

| Property | Type |
|---|---|
| `Title` | TEXT |
| `Show Footer` | BOOLEAN |
| `Content` | SLOT |
| `Footer` | SLOT |

Tokeny: `component/panel/background`, `component/panel/border`, `component/panel/title/foreground`, …

**Nowe overlaye** (dialog, drawer, popover…) — kopiuj ten schemat: Header + Content slot + Footer slot + `Show Footer`.

## Ramka nadrzędna — zostaw fiolet Figma

The **component set chrome** (purple dashed border) must stay visible. Do not clear strokes or fills on `COMPONENT_SET`.

Default chrome (match existing sets like `button`):

```javascript
const COMPONENT_SET_CHROME = {
  strokes: [{ type: 'SOLID', color: { r: 0.592, g: 0.278, b: 1 }, opacity: 1 }],
  dashPattern: [10, 5],
  strokeWeight: 1,
  strokeAlign: 'INSIDE',
};

function ensureComponentSetChrome(componentSet) {
  if (!componentSet.strokes || componentSet.strokes.length === 0) {
    componentSet.strokes = COMPONENT_SET_CHROME.strokes;
    componentSet.dashPattern = COMPONENT_SET_CHROME.dashPattern;
    componentSet.strokeWeight = COMPONENT_SET_CHROME.strokeWeight;
    componentSet.strokeAlign = COMPONENT_SET_CHROME.strokeAlign;
  }
}
// After figma.combineAsVariants(...): ensureComponentSetChrome(componentSet);
```

```javascript
// ❌ BAD — removes visible component-set frame
componentSet.strokes = [];
componentSet.fills = [];
await bindFill(componentSet, tokenId);

// ✅ GOOD — tokeny tylko na wewnętrznej powierzchni komponentu
await bindFill(dialogSurface, 'VariableID:…');
// component set: name, opis, layout, resize — nigdy strokes/fills na set
```

| Layer | Stroke / fill |
|---|---|
| **Component set** | Purple dashed border (`#9747FF`, dash 10/5) — **never clear** |
| **Inner surface** (modal, panel, cell…) | `component/*` in **Theme** |

## Theme collection — Generic → semantic/* → component/*

Collection name: **Theme** (Light | Dark).

```
Generic  →  semantic/*  →  component/*
```

- **Never** bind Figma nodes to Generic or `semantic/*` directly.
- **Always** bind to `component/*` (color, stroke, spacing, radius, typography, opacity, shadow).
- Each `component/*` variable aliases exactly one `semantic/*` variable per mode.

Groups: `semantic/color/foreground/primary`, `semantic/spacing/l`, … and `component/card/background`, `component/button/primary/background/default`, … One mode toggle for both groups.

**Ekrany w Designs** (scrim, overlay, własne frame): tokeny + zakaz hex — `.cursor/rules/figma-designs-tokens.mdc`.
